Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.75,0:00:03.63,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I had a friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.40,0:00:09.10,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The first friend I ever made, Nagase Koito.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.48,0:00:12.14,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,She was pretty and kind.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.06,0:00:15.34,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,She complimented me on things I'm sensitive about.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.32,0:00:19.06,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's mysterious.\NYou shouldn't hide it.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.20,0:00:21.07,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's pretty.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.60,0:00:25.22,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Be my friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.35,0:00:31.92,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Let's be best friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.23,0:00:36.77,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,If we could, I'd be happy.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.18,0:00:38.79,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Me, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.32,0:00:41.03,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.38,0:00:45.03,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,she suddenly died.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.98,0:00:50.42,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Why, Koito?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.60,0:00:58.95,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,After that, I stopped going to school.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.79,0:01:06.37,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Now I'm mad!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.46,0:01:13.62,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Instead, I started fighting my battle.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.63,0:01:19.22,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,By buying weird eggs, I was able to visit a world of dreams.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.17,0:01:26.51,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I protected Egg girls from Seeno Evils and Wonder Killers,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.06,0:01:28.63,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,and when I cleared my missions...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.05,0:01:32.90,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Too bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.31,0:01:34.55,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Only you get saved.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.92,0:01:36.78,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But you have to cheer up.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.71,0:01:39.64,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,If you want your best friend back.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.93,0:01:42.39,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,She's a little warm.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.20,0:01:45.01,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Because I protected Kurumi?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.78,0:01:50.42,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hey, if I protect a bunch more people, \Nwill Koito come back to life?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.00,0:01:53.09,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,She will, right?!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.13,0:01:59.01,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I wanted to know why Koito killed herself.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.16,0:02:03.21,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I hear Mr. Sawaki's entering it in the next exhibition.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.08,0:02:07.55,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,He says he wants to win a prize\Nand make a living as a painter.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.41,0:02:09.50,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,A painting of me?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.92,0:02:10.75,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Confident?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.81,0:02:13.65,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,If not, you should decline.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.32,0:02:16.49,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Mr. Sawaki's future is on the line.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.33,0:02:19.23,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Why, Koito?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.88,0:02:22.70,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,There was a part of me that resented her.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.95,0:02:27.56,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We were friends, so why didn't she talk to me?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.00,0:02:33.97,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Why?!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.63,0:04:10.98,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I always bought the Eggs deep underneath a shopping mall.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.68,0:04:15.93,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I made new friends there.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.67,0:04:19.20,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'll pay you back for the Egg.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.31,0:04:19.99,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Promise.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.78,0:04:21.76,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,This is Rika.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.50,0:04:24.35,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,She's cheerful and full of energy.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.12,0:04:26.81,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,She used to be a junior idol.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.70,0:04:30.30,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,A group called All-Out Kiss. Ever heard of us?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.47,0:04:31.20,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Never.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.49,0:04:33.14,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We broke up.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.31,0:04:35.12,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,All the others were too ugly.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.98,0:04:39.04,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Anyway, I forgot my wallet.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.39,0:04:41.02,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Sorry, but could you spot me cash?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.63,0:04:46.24,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,If only she weren't so tightfisted with money.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.96,0:04:48.51,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Come see me again, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.48,0:04:50.31,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Just kidding!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.00,0:04:55.84,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Rika wanted to bring a girl who was her fan back to life.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.65,0:04:59.25,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,After that, another fan told me what happened.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.69,0:05:01.06,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Chiemi died.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.63,0:05:04.43,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,She was skin and bones, like a mummy.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.02,0:05:07.11,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I couldn't forget her if I wanted to.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.79,0:05:08.55,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,This...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.94,0:05:10.59,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,This isn't Chiemi.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.04,0:05:16.51,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Umm...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.51,0:05:21.19,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Are you okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.95,0:05:25.55,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,How do I look to you?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.99,0:05:27.16,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,This is Momo.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.94,0:05:30.86,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,She looks boyish, but she loves cute things.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.34,0:05:33.26,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,A sunflower.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.16,0:05:37.69,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's really cute.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.14,0:05:44.17,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Momo wanted to save a classmate\Nwho said that she loved her.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.38,0:05:49.04,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,There are more than you'd think, Haruka.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.27,0:05:52.78,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Girls like you, who say they love me.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.52,0:06:01.46,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That girl...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.42,0:06:03.50,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Wow.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.61,0:06:06.09,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yes, we're always worried about her—
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.09,0:06:07.91,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,She's got an amazing figure!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.91,0:06:08.70,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Oh, that.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.55,0:06:11.54,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,And this is Neiru.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.29,0:06:13.98,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You're sure it's not for yourself?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.33,0:06:16.27,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What do you mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.45,0:06:20.03,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You don't like who you are now, so you go.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.69,0:06:21.96,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Even if you're scared.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.47,0:06:24.33,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You want to change the self you hate.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.86,0:06:31.22,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,She's cool and levelheaded, \Nbut she's adorable when she laughs.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.19,0:06:34.17,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,She runs a big company.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.72,0:06:38.46,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,This is my first secretary, Tanabe Misaki.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.97,0:06:39.58,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hello.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.99,0:06:43.34,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Are you familiar with a group called Plati?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.99,0:06:48.44,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yes. I heard only people with really high IQs can join.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.92,0:06:51.94,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ms. Neiru is a member of Japan Plati.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.26,0:06:54.76,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I was born via artificial insemination of a member.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.71,0:06:59.22,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Neiru is fighting for her little sister.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.98,0:07:01.55,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,My sister stabbed me.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.03,0:07:04.66,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Then she ran away and jumped off a bridge.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.94,0:07:07.10,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The scar aches and keeps me awake.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.12,0:07:12.15,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But the pain has faded since I started going there.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.29,0:07:17.36,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,When I try to forget her, my scar aches, like a curse.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.08,0:07:19.12,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That's why I go.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.78,0:07:22.08,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,No other reason.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.12,0:07:25.10,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.15,0:07:28.30,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,When I went to hang out at Neiru's place,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.00,0:07:32.65,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,she introduced me to her friend Kotobuki.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.19,0:07:35.40,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Someone's inside.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.87,0:07:39.88,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Awano Kotobuki. She was born at Japan Plati like I was.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.23,0:07:41.17,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Kotobuki.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.50,0:07:45.67,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Kotobuki was always cheerful and optimistic.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.68,0:07:48.54,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,She'd tell me to "really enjoy myself."
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.19,0:07:49.83,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,"Was"?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.36,0:07:52.00,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Isn't she just sleeping?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.70,0:07:54.88,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,She's in a vegetative state.\NHuh?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.47,0:07:57.67,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Kotobuki was a doctor of psychiatry.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.11,0:08:00.90,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,She was scientifically analyzing the mysteries of life.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.37,0:08:03.34,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Death, in particular.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.23,0:08:08.79,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,She performed near-death experiments \Nand eventually didn't come back.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.20,0:08:10.94,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I met Kotobuki in a dream.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.28,0:08:11.74,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,A dream?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.59,0:08:13.52,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,An Egg dream.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.20,0:08:17.05,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The me in the world you're in did die.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.62,0:08:19.52,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But that allowed me to experience it.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.91,0:08:23.03,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I was right, Neiru: Parallel worlds do exist!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.57,0:08:26.21,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The possibility of worlds that might have been.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.47,0:08:28.89,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It was your favorite genre of fiction.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.80,0:08:32.57,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yes! Our parallel selves are alive!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.86,0:08:35.53,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You made new friends, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.53,0:08:39.16,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You're softer than you used to be.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.88,0:08:41.94,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But they're not like us.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.35,0:08:44.17,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You made connections with people.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.45,0:08:46.12,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That's a wonderful thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.40,0:08:48.34,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Treasure them.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.32,0:08:51.13,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You aren't there.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.24,0:08:55.34,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'll make friends with those girls in another world-line.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.29,0:09:05.57,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Doctor what's-his-name had pride, if nothing else.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.98,0:09:06.97,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Pride chicken.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.06,0:09:10.53,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Was it that funny?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.03,0:09:13.15,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You sounded like a friend of mine.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.55,0:09:16.23,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Bravo.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.93,0:09:22.09,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,President Aonuma is getting closer\Nto the truth behind the temptation of death.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.70,0:09:24.47,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Kotobuki did give her a hint.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.03,0:09:26.27,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Innocent sorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.07,0:09:29.84,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You managed to deflect her with an excuse, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.34,0:09:32.83,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Girls' suicides.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.26,0:09:36.63,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,If we told them the real reason, none of them would fight.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.78,0:09:40.76,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yeah. Not if they knew the root cause is the two of us.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.02,0:09:43.63,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,These two are Acca and Ura-Acca.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.41,0:09:48.55,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm Acca. The one to your left is Ura-Acca.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.73,0:09:50.13,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.71,0:09:53.51,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,They're the ones who made the Eggs.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.90,0:09:57.98,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You're both involved with Japan Plati?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.00,0:10:00.11,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What do you mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.28,0:10:01.31,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Don't play dumb.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.63,0:10:04.77,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I saw Misaki talking with you guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.14,0:10:06.10,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,They're founders.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.29,0:10:09.20,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Those two founded Japan Plati.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.72,0:10:11.85,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Right is Acca. Left is Ura-Acca.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.69,0:10:14.82,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,So, they were both human?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.58,0:10:16.86,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We still are.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.15,0:10:19.64,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We abandoned our bodies and kept just our brains.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.76,0:10:24.13,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Once young scientific geniuses, now just dummies.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.47,0:10:25.68,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Break the egg.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.99,0:10:27.39,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Break the egg.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.16,0:10:34.12,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,They led us into playing this game.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.75,0:10:36.27,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Veni{\i0}.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.41,0:10:46.03,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,A snake.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.09,0:10:49.08,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hello?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.27,0:10:55.75,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm not sure how to react.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.42,0:11:04.38,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,They did a lot to support us, \Nlike giving me Leon as a power-up.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.68,0:11:07.28,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Four!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.68,0:11:08.34,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Five!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.68,0:11:08.34,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Three!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.68,0:11:08.36,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,So, I thought they were on our side.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.86,0:11:09.98,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Two!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.86,0:11:09.98,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Until that day.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.98,0:11:10.56,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,One!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.98,0:11:11.73,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Zero!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.64,0:11:18.44,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Haruka?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.37,0:11:21.23,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Momoe?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.89,0:11:26.30,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The first one of us to clear this game was Momo.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.55,0:11:32.28,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Bad girl.\NI’ll tell teacher on you.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.01,0:11:35.80,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Congratulations. You completed your mission.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.34,0:11:37.59,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That girl came back to life.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.40,0:11:38.85,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Veni{\i0}!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.32,0:11:40.59,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'd like to let you go.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.17,0:11:45.08,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Out of respect for the way you've\Nrisked your life for friendship.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.49,0:11:49.09,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But you see, Frill will get mad at me if she finds out.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.89,0:11:51.40,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Do you want to die here?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.04,0:12:01.65,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Well, I figured.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.94,0:12:09.84,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,They say crocodile tastes like chicken.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.42,0:12:18.71,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Have some, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.95,0:12:22.00,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Her partner Panic was killed,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.51,0:12:24.95,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,and she had an overwhelming\Nfear of death implanted in her.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.87,0:12:28.76,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I wish I'd never gotten mixed up in this mess.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.20,0:12:34.08,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Why did you call out to me?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.77,0:12:38.75,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It was the same for Rika.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.61,0:12:42.54,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Rika?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.49,0:12:50.11,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Mannen!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.43,0:12:52.88,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Huh? What?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.66,0:12:57.56,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm Dot.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.24,0:13:01.41,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Dot won't kill you. Good girl.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.50,0:13:04.42,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Just copying Hyphen, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.92,0:13:11.94,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Are you okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.95,0:13:19.31,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You can eat it.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.85,0:13:22.10,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Dot doesn't like meat.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.76,0:13:31.82,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's an old story.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.56,0:13:35.15,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We made a girl.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.99,0:13:38.30,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,One of the Eggs' creators...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.30,0:13:39.35,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Just for fun.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.03,0:13:44.61,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ura-Acca, told me about their past.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.76,0:13:48.80,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What shall we name her?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.26,0:13:50.88,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Don't jump the gun.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.13,0:13:52.89,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,How about we let her decide?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.18,0:13:54.34,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That's an idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.05,0:13:55.80,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,And the visual?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.08,0:13:58.07,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Mmm!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.14,0:14:03.15,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We tried to picture a being\Nthat we could love like a daughter.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.27,0:14:06.86,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That would make us forget that it was an AI.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.57,0:14:11.78,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Unstable and complicated, like\Nthe midpoint between childhood and adulthood.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.82,0:14:14.78,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We set her age as 14.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.53,0:14:19.45,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What is your name?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.37,0:14:24.75,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Frill.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.25,0:14:26.59,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That's a lovely name.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.21,0:14:30.46,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Under surveillance in a closed-off society,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.13,0:14:33.13,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,we lived like a family.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.60,0:14:39.06,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,More and more often,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.72,0:14:43.44,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,there were moments when we forgot that Frill was an AI.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.91,0:14:58.49,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I should have picked up on it then.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.45,0:15:01.62,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,On what Frill wanted.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.33,0:15:07.79,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ow! It hurts!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.04,0:15:08.96,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.13,0:15:10.13,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Stop it!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.17,0:15:15.51,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It hurts...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.80,0:15:17.89,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It "hurts"?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.68,0:15:22.02,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,All you're doing is detecting inputs.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.02,0:15:26.23,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Please!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.60,0:15:28.23,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Not the dark!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.73,0:15:31.65,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Not the scary place!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.20,0:15:38.28,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,There was nothing I could say or do
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.03,0:15:40.95,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,as a few more years passed.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.20,0:15:44.71,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What saved Acca and me from that...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.13,0:15:52.88,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,was Himari, the daughter Azusa left behind.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.88,0:15:58.22,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,She almost brought us back from our\Nlowest point to how we used to be.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.05,0:16:03.81,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Uncle, is it true you and my dad fought over my mom?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.89,0:16:07.27,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Who'd you hear that from?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.27,0:16:09.06,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I look like my mom, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.90,0:16:11.15,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'll get more like her.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.36,0:16:13.36,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yeah, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.44,0:16:17.03,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,If you wait, I wouldn't mind marrying you.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.45,0:16:22.58,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Don't try to act grown-up, kid.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.37,0:16:26.58,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm not a kid! I'm in junior high!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.55,0:16:38.93,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That night, Himari died.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.59,0:16:43.31,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It looked like suicide, but there was no note.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.64,0:16:49.56,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It was you?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.10,0:16:51.69,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You killed Himari?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.44,0:16:53.52,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What's wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.94,0:16:56.32,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You won't give me a kiss after so long?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.07,0:16:58.36,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You did something.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.86,0:17:00.74,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You used Hyphen and Dot.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.99,0:17:02.78,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,"You're such a good girl, Frill"?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.99,0:17:04.16,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Cut the crap!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.53,0:17:05.99,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You monster!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.12,0:17:11.79,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Listen, I want to get out of here.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.42,0:17:13.63,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Don't you want to know?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.00,0:17:15.17,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,About that girl?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.84,0:17:21.22,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Don't you want to know how that girl, \Nwho loved her "uncle" so much, died?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.82,0:17:25.98,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Frill!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.47,0:17:28.06,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Are you going to kill me?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.93,0:17:30.14,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Shut up, monster.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.73,0:17:32.60,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,1000)}My. Name. Is.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.48,0:17:34.06,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Frill.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.94,0:17:37.69,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Don't pretend not to see me.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.78,0:17:40.90,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I was born from the two of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.45,0:17:43.32,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We started investigating.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.95,0:17:47.70,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We gathered and analyzed data\Non girls' suicides in that age range.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.29,0:17:49.71,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,There were many causes.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.37,0:17:53.25,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But we wondered if there could also be another push
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.50,0:17:55.34,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,that drove them to suicide.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.59,0:17:57.25,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The temptation of death?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.71,0:18:02.05,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Unless it's stopped, girls will end\Nup dying when they don't have to.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.09,0:18:04.68,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,All because of our mistake.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.18,0:18:10.85,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,So, we made the Wonder Eggs and looked\Nfor a way to interfere with their plans.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.10,0:18:15.48,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What did she think?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.94,0:18:17.86,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Not a clue.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.32,0:18:21.45,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What made you want to at least tell Ai?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.82,0:18:22.86,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I don't know that either.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.61,0:18:27.45,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But closing her heart out of fear,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.33,0:18:30.04,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,or building walls out of hatred
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.79,0:18:33.21,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,would just make her easy prey for Frill.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.08,0:18:37.03,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You mean she'd repeat our mistakes?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.76,0:18:46.64,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You don't actually care about Frill, do you?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.55,0:18:48.43,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What do you mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.85,0:18:51.93,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,As long as you can save Himari.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.60,0:18:54.81,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Isn't that how we've always been?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.45,0:19:12.16,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,And then, I met...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.45,0:19:12.16,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You're...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.83,0:19:14.75,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,me.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.83,0:19:17.75,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.88,0:19:19.88,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Tell me, Acca! Ura-Acca!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.67,0:19:23.97,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Are you familiar with the term "parallel world"?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.84,0:19:26.05,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Only in comic books.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.01,0:19:28.47,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,They actually exist.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.39,0:19:33.68,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,When someone makes an important\Nchoice, or when they don't,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.10,0:19:37.23,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,another them is created in a different, divergent space-time.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.36,0:19:42.69,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I hate to say it, but in a different\Nspace-time, the Ai you see there...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.19,0:19:46.15,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You killed yourself, didn't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.45,0:19:53.16,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Those are Seeno Evils. They're after you.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.45,0:19:55.66,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But don't worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.33,0:19:57.50,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'll protect you.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.50,0:19:59.33,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You will?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.71,0:20:04.46,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You see,\NI've gotten stronger.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.63,0:20:08.55,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm sick of this.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.85,0:20:17.31,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Crosswalks are still scary\Neven when you move with the crowd.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.60,0:20:21.11,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm done pretending not to see!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.36,0:20:22.19,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm going
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.32,0:20:24.19,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,to change.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.45,0:20:31.32,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You just want attention!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.20,0:20:36.62,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What you really mean is that you\Nwant someone to find you and love you!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.41,0:20:38.96,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,So, I won't leave you alone!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.79,0:20:41.00,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I {\i1}can't{\i0} leave you alone!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.13,0:20:45.05,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Now I'm really mad!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.55,0:20:49.22,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm fighting to save my friend Koito.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.01,0:20:50.93,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Your friend?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.46,0:20:51.90,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.80,0:20:56.27,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I don't know anything about Koito.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.68,0:20:59.06,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ai likes Mr. Sawaki, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.90,0:21:03.11,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,There's no reason to have a complex.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.61,0:21:05.78,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Your eyes are charming.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.90,0:21:07.65,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.61,0:21:11.87,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,going to go to school!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.91,0:21:16.58,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We've been thinking that we'd like to start dating.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.04,0:21:19.92,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Me?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.50,0:21:21.83,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's you, grown up.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.67,0:21:26.63,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Someday, you'll be a wonderful,\Nadult woman like your mother.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.05,0:21:29.67,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You love my mom, don't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.72,0:21:32.68,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yes. With all my heart.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.72,0:21:35.35,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You're her daughter,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.39,0:21:39.23,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,so you should have faith in yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.10,0:21:41.65,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You be happy too, Mom.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.48,0:21:45.86,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You've got my full support.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.28,0:21:48.19,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.53,0:21:52.36,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I see. You made a friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.20,0:21:54.95,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Now I have others, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.08,0:21:57.95,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Neiru, Rika, Momo.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.20,0:21:59.00,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That many?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.41,0:22:01.58,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yeah.\NSo, you're happy?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.34,0:22:07.38,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Super happy.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:08.00,0:22:11.72,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Mr. Sawaki, there's something I want to ask you.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:12.68,0:22:15.14,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Why did Koito die?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:17.81,0:22:18.35,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Five!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:19.22,0:22:19.62,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Four!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:20.64,0:22:21.04,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Three!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:22.27,0:22:22.67,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Two!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:23.77,0:22:24.23,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,One!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:25.27,0:22:25.94,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Zero!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:31.40,0:22:32.15,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Koito!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:40.50,0:22:43.08,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Isn't that great, other me?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:47.71,0:22:49.25,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You can see her again soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:51.18,0:22:55.09,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I thought I wanted to hear the truth from Koito.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:55.72,0:22:56.51,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Maybe I don't.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:57.14,0:22:57.97,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You don't?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:58.81,0:22:59.22,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:00.14,0:23:02.39,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I think I feel grateful.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:03.18,0:23:04.48,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Even if she was a fake friend?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:05.35,0:23:08.65,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I was saved back then.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:09.27,0:23:10.65,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I wasn't alone anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:12.53,0:23:13.15,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I've decided.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:14.20,0:23:14.70,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,About what?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:15.53,0:23:17.53,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm going to become a warrior of Eros.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:17.93,0:23:18.83,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:19.41,0:23:21.83,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'll fight Thanatos, the temptation of death.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:22.45,0:23:24.83,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I don't know how to go to parallel worlds yet,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:26.08,0:23:27.83,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,but someday, I'll bring you back.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:28.67,0:23:31.38,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm sure your mom is sad.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:32.17,0:23:34.67,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,And I want to get strong like you.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:36.20,0:23:37.89,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That's silly.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:38.39,0:23:39.60,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm you, aren't I?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:40.68,0:23:43.02,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I guess so.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:45.35,0:23:46.23,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I promise.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:47.40,0:23:49.11,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Okay. I'll be waiting.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:49.61,0:23:51.70,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ah. Ah!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:52.49,0:23:53.12,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ah.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:54.68,0:23:56.29,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ah! Ah.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:55.63,0:23:56.97,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Redi{\i0}.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:57.11,0:23:57.86,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I am
Dialogue: 0,0:23:58.87,0:24:02.70,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Kirara Rodriguez Matured XVIII Evening Star SS Plum.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:07.79,0:24:09.25,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,So shiny.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:17.30,0:24:19.80,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The other... me?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:21.18,0:24:23.85,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,She... protected me.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:28.56,0:24:29.06,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ai!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:33.11,0:24:35.11,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I want shiny things.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:36.03,0:24:36.90,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,"Shiny"?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:43.83,0:24:44.66,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Even I...
Dialogue: 0,0:24:54.59,0:24:56.30,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Good luck, me.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:00.09,0:25:00.84,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:09.52,0:25:10.48,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:15.15,0:25:18.40,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm sure you've fantasized about it, haven't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:19.45,0:25:23.41,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But I'm sorry to say, it will never come true.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:24.91,0:25:29.46,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Because your place is gone now.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:41.22,0:25:42.39,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Are you hesitating?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:43.14,0:25:43.54,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:45.39,0:25:47.39,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,There's no need to hesitate.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:48.14,0:25:49.52,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You did your duty.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:49.77,0:25:51.39,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Today onward belongs to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:51.85,0:25:53.44,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Let's live selfishly.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:53.98,0:25:56.23,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Selfishness is the privilege of children.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:59.15,0:26:01.91,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Selfish!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:06.41,0:26:09.66,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But I think I'm more like an adult.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:10.71,0:26:12.42,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Maybe that's why you're unhappy.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:13.79,0:26:14.63,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I suppose.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:29.43,0:26:30.10,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Good morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:32.35,0:26:33.02,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:37.27,0:26:38.57,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's kind of chilly today.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:39.23,0:26:40.74,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's supposed to snow tonight.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:42.90,0:26:44.20,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Really? It's so nice out.\NYes.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:50.75,0:26:51.54,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,See you.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:51.96,0:26:53.46,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Oh, sure. Later.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:11.98,0:27:13.10,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Adam.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:28.74,0:27:30.12,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry this is so sudden.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:30.95,0:27:32.79,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Please take care of Adam for a while.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:33.66,0:27:35.21,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I can trust you with him, Ai.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:18.85,0:28:22.39,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,She caused a problem with a male teacher at her last school.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:24.10,0:28:28.11,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,He committed suicide after that, \Nalthough I'm told he had a family.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:29.11,0:28:30.98,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,She contacted me frequently as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:31.65,0:28:33.95,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,She asked me to come to the roof that day.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:34.20,0:28:37.28,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,She threatened that she would jump off if I didn't.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:38.70,0:28:43.12,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Apparently, she shouted that I had raped her \Nand anything else she could think of.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:43.83,0:28:50.30,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Then, when no one was watching \Nher, she lost her balance and...
Dialogue: 0,0:28:52.71,0:28:53.17,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:56.01,0:28:56.89,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Koito...
Dialogue: 0,0:28:58.10,0:28:59.47,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I, umm...
Dialogue: 0,0:28:59.93,0:29:01.31,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ohto, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:02.02,0:29:03.18,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Aren't you acting awfully familiar?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:03.68,0:29:05.69,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's not like we're friends.\NHuh?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:06.48,0:29:07.81,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Koito, let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:08.24,0:29:09.17,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:12.90,0:29:13.69,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Where should we eat?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:13.99,0:29:15.15,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Let's go out today.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:15.28,0:29:15.86,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Out?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:16.06,0:29:17.32,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:16.06,0:29:17.43,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:16.78,0:29:17.32,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Maybe Chinese?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:17.57,0:29:19.45,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,There was no one on the stairs over there.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:19.45,0:29:19.91,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:21.37,0:29:25.96,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You brought me an umbrella on a rainy day \Nand said we should be best friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:27.25,0:29:29.25,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Look at the color of this eye!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:32.50,0:29:34.72,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You told me it was pretty!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:35.92,0:29:37.22,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That I shouldn't hide it!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:38.01,0:29:38.55,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Who's she?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:39.01,0:29:41.47,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Mr. Sawaki's model for his next exhibition.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:42.68,0:29:43.38,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Her? Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:43.64,0:29:44.35,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:44.68,0:29:45.23,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Whoa!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:48.81,0:29:51.36,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I always knew Mr. Sawaki was kind.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:23.10,0:30:23.68,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Neiru!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:24.51,0:30:25.60,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Oh, hello, Ms. Tanabe.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:28.06,0:30:29.73,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Sorry to bother you at work.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:30.48,0:30:32.65,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I was worried because I couldn't reach you.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:33.19,0:30:34.86,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I wanted to ask about this morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:36.94,0:30:38.03,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You have the wrong person.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:38.74,0:30:41.16,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You should leave before someone calls security.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:41.99,0:30:42.45,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Neiru?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:43.74,0:30:45.45,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I don't know you.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:46.50,0:30:48.29,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Stop joking like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:49.00,0:30:50.87,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We're friends, aren't we?!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:51.75,0:30:53.79,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,One-sided affection is a nuisance.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:55.30,0:30:58.22,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I won't be your friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:27.95,0:31:28.45,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,They're gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:30.41,0:31:34.46,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,My photos with Koito... are all gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:25.81,0:32:30.35,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,♪ Come on, let's go play the lost maiden's ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:32:30.35,0:32:35.05,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,♪ Game of advice, let's take turns and talk ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:32:32.02,0:32:35.05,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ai-kyun!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:37.44,0:32:39.27,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,When a dead person comes back,
Dialogue: 0,0:32:39.61,0:32:43.45,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,it creates noise that changes our \Nnormal lives a little, Acca said.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:44.36,0:32:45.86,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Oh!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:46.74,0:32:50.04,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It seems like Chiemi forgot all about me, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:50.99,0:32:53.41,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,When I told her I forgot my wallet, she said,
Dialogue: 0,0:32:53.79,0:32:55.17,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,"Tough luck, dummy.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:55.33,0:32:58.88,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm lining up for a shot with Makorin."
Dialogue: 0,0:32:59.17,0:33:04.47,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Haruka got asked out by an older student \Nand got all excited to start dating.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:04.47,0:33:05.63,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:05.84,0:33:09.30,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,She said getting an old-fashioned\Nlove letter made her heart flutter.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:09.97,0:33:12.60,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What were her feelings for me, then?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:12.60,0:33:14.89,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Who does she think brought her back?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:15.35,0:33:17.56,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Still, I wonder what happened to Neiru.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:18.02,0:33:20.44,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Maybe she cleared it, too,
Dialogue: 0,0:33:21.15,0:33:23.78,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,and that's why she's giving us the cold shoulder?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:24.32,0:33:25.20,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Rika.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:27.53,0:33:30.62,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Want to go after this? It's been ages.\NHuh?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:32.62,0:33:35.08,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Oh! You mean the capsule machine!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:35.29,0:33:35.75,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:36.29,0:33:39.04,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I guess the Accas might know about Neiru.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:39.67,0:33:40.07,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Right?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:40.63,0:33:44.46,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Let's not.\NI mean, we all finally cleared it.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:46.30,0:33:48.01,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Here, Rika. It's your turn.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:50.47,0:33:52.60,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I can't get in on my own.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:53.81,0:33:56.52,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,They might let me in if you're with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:57.10,0:33:58.31,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm not going.\NHuh?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:00.56,0:34:03.86,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Did you forget about the thing that killed Mannen?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:04.57,0:34:05.78,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,As if I could.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:07.11,0:34:08.95,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Don't you want to get even?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:11.41,0:34:13.70,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Even if I did, I'd just get hurt.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:14.16,0:34:15.87,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That doesn't bother me.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:16.20,0:34:18.67,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,No matter how bad they hurt me, I'll—
Dialogue: 0,0:34:18.67,0:34:20.79,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I don't want to get hurt.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:22.54,0:34:23.38,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Coward.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:24.25,0:34:24.80,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Rika.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:26.21,0:34:28.05,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,If something happened to Momo,
Dialogue: 0,0:34:29.43,0:34:30.93,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I know you'd regret it.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:34.64,0:34:36.60,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Then I'd just go save her again.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:39.23,0:34:39.85,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Me, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:40.77,0:34:41.56,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:42.06,0:34:42.90,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,No, thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:45.69,0:34:46.65,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,For telling me.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:48.15,0:34:51.24,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Okay, let's sing until we drop today!\NYeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:02.33,0:35:04.63,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Rika.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:07.17,0:35:08.63,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Bye. This is my stop.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:20.89,0:35:25.02,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I mean, Makorin? I don't get why she's even popular.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:25.32,0:35:26.90,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Isn't Rika-pyon's cuter?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:32.66,0:35:33.24,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:33.70,0:35:34.41,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:36.20,0:35:37.37,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That's not mine.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:38.24,0:35:39.12,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Is it mine?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:40.37,0:35:41.75,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I don't know this number.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:42.04,0:35:42.83,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Creepy.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:45.50,0:35:48.55,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Maybe... it's Neiru?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:50.34,0:35:51.13,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Oh!\NHello?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:51.55,0:35:52.80,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Is this Ohto Ai?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:53.26,0:35:53.80,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:54.26,0:35:55.43,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,This is Tanabe, the secretary.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:56.56,0:35:57.85,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Oh. Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:58.39,0:36:01.23,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Excuse me. I'll get straight to the point.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:01.77,0:36:02.31,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:03.23,0:36:06.36,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The girl you met at the office isn't Neiru.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:07.19,0:36:09.90,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The real Neiru is currently missing.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:12.07,0:36:13.36,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Please wait a second.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:22.71,0:36:26.71,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The girl you met at the office is Neiru's younger sister, Airu.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:27.54,0:36:29.42,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Neiru cleared her mission.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:30.13,0:36:31.92,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I had no idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:33.17,0:36:38.55,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I mean, her sister stabbed her.\NI'm sure they didn't make up right away.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:38.89,0:36:40.93,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But why run away without a word?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:41.93,0:36:46.27,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I think that she was afraid to tell you about herself.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:47.86,0:36:52.44,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What I'd like you to watch now is \Na recording of Neiru's last dream.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:53.57,0:36:56.11,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I believe that Neiru would want you to know, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:58.32,0:36:59.91,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Excuse us.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:02.75,0:37:07.12,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,After Kotobuki's passing, Neiru lived here.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:08.04,0:37:10.59,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I think she enjoyed living here.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:15.80,0:37:16.55,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You're right.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:17.09,0:37:18.47,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It smells like Neiru.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:18.80,0:37:19.47,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You sure?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:25.48,0:37:26.81,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Welcome back, Tanabe.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:28.60,0:37:29.56,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Is that them?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:30.56,0:37:31.52,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Kotobuki?!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:32.07,0:37:33.94,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You came back to life, too?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:34.49,0:37:40.16,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm not dead.\NI came here because the me in this world died.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:40.70,0:37:42.99,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Two of me can't exist at the same time.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:43.29,0:37:43.87,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:44.33,0:37:45.91,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You're a parallel Kotobuki?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:46.25,0:37:48.50,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Right. You're quick on the uptake.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:48.83,0:37:49.46,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,"Parallel"?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:49.92,0:37:52.13,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,She's Kotobuki, but a different one.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:52.54,0:37:53.38,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,She is?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:54.21,0:37:54.63,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:57.67,0:38:00.93,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,All right, let's hurry up and watch Neiru's dream.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:01.80,0:38:04.89,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I can't believe you came to save me.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:05.39,0:38:07.18,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The scar on my back aches.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:07.64,0:38:11.19,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,If you're sending me back, does that mean you'll stay here?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:12.31,0:38:15.36,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'll go back, too. I want to see my friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:15.90,0:38:18.07,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:18.40,0:38:20.49,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But I'm sorry to say, that's not where you belong.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:21.20,0:38:21.95,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Adios.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:23.33,0:38:24.45,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Her sister pisses me off.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:29.12,0:38:30.71,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Three of you?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:31.12,0:38:32.88,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I see I get VIP treatment.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:33.79,0:38:34.29,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Redi{\i0}.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:35.50,0:38:38.01,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Are you... stupid?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:39.51,0:38:41.51,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Didn't your friends tell you?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:41.80,0:38:44.63,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,If you sacrifice your pet, you get to live.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:45.31,0:38:48.43,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Only my best friend is allowed to call me stupid.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:50.85,0:38:54.61,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm going to blow your minds!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:56.48,0:38:59.24,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I think that we could be friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:00.49,0:39:00.99,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:01.78,0:39:04.03,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Because you're like me.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:04.24,0:39:06.74,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,And I know what you really want.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:07.24,0:39:09.75,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The wish that your friends wouldn't understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:10.79,0:39:13.58,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,If you'll be my friend, you can become...
Dialogue: 0,0:39:14.75,0:39:15.88,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,human.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:21.93,0:39:22.97,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Bravo.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:23.47,0:39:24.47,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What did she mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:25.10,0:39:29.39,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Apparently, the me from here built an AI in Airu's image.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:30.01,0:39:30.69,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:31.14,0:39:34.69,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,She was too good, so Airu got jealous of her.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:35.69,0:39:36.69,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm out.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:37.27,0:39:39.28,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I don't want to die for a machine.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:40.03,0:39:42.15,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,There never was a Neiru.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:45.03,0:39:47.28,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,She seemed like she was in a bad mood.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:47.95,0:39:49.91,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry. Excuse me.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:54.54,0:39:55.13,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ms. Ohto.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:55.75,0:39:56.21,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yes?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:59.63,0:40:00.84,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'll be right back.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:06.89,0:40:09.81,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Is all that parallel world stuff for real?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:10.31,0:40:14.98,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yeah. I even met a me from another world in that world.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:15.44,0:40:15.94,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Oh.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:16.77,0:40:20.11,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Come to think of it, that capsule machine is 500 yen a pop.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:20.48,0:40:22.61,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I guess lives couldn't be that cheap.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:23.15,0:40:24.07,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I guess not.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:24.78,0:40:29.58,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,People coming back the same\Nas before is just too good to be true, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:30.49,0:40:33.71,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Neiru's place really screamed "Neiru," huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:34.04,0:40:35.96,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yeah. I can kind of picture it.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:41.34,0:40:43.26,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Rika, let's go back already.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:45.04,0:40:46.26,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'll die, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:47.01,0:40:47.59,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Rika...
Dialogue: 0,0:40:48.22,0:40:49.18,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'll die.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:52.93,0:40:53.85,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna die.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:55.02,0:40:55.73,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I miss them.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:56.85,0:40:59.06,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Mannen.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:59.52,0:41:03.44,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Chiemi.\NI miss them. I want to see them again.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:04.40,0:41:05.03,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:05.90,0:41:06.53,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:02.79,0:42:04.00,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:05.17,0:42:08.43,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's all right, Ai.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:09.47,0:42:11.68,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I did something awful.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:13.01,0:42:13.56,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:14.51,0:42:16.27,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It was really hard.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:17.64,0:42:20.06,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Don't worry. I understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:22.81,0:42:26.19,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Listen, if you rest up, you can get back on your feet.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:27.32,0:42:27.90,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I know it.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:34.91,0:42:36.20,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Today's weather is sunny.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:36.91,0:42:41.63,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The TV said it would be comfortable, \Nbut it's a little chilly for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:47.80,0:42:49.63,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I've gotten used to my new school.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:50.63,0:42:55.72,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I didn't want to transfer, but there was \Nno point going to my old school anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:57.35,0:42:59.89,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I wonder if Neiru managed to become human.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:00.98,0:43:03.73,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry I didn't pick up the phone that day.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:05.11,0:43:07.61,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I was really busy for a while after that.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:08.19,0:43:10.32,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I kind of drifted apart from everyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:11.57,0:43:14.83,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Still, I'll never forget that time.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:15.91,0:43:19.00,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I could never forget such a thrilling season.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:20.41,0:43:23.25,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I wish I could feel like that again.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:25.17,0:43:26.46,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's kind of chilly today.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:26.75,0:43:28.55,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's supposed to snow tonight.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:28.55,0:43:30.34,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Really? It's so nice out.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:08.50,0:44:09.25,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I've got to go.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:24.14,0:44:25.27,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,How nice to see you.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:27.94,0:44:29.15,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I want to see Neiru!
Dialogue: 0,0:44:30.15,0:44:31.19,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Will you buy an Egg?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:31.82,0:44:33.70,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We would be thrilled if you would.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:34.32,0:44:36.62,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But what will you do if you can't see Neiru?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:37.16,0:44:39.13,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,She might not want to see you.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:39.53,0:44:41.62,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'll try again. As many times as it takes.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:42.29,0:44:45.12,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I know that Neiru wants to see me.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:45.71,0:44:48.84,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Talk about confident. You already ran away once.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:49.59,0:44:50.30,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ura-Acca.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:54.72,0:44:55.88,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ohto Ai...
Dialogue: 0,0:44:57.55,0:44:58.26,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,is back!
Dialogue: 0,0:46:35.23,0:46:36.48,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ready, set...
Dialogue: 0,0:46:36.82,0:46:37.49,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The end!
